# KLayout LEF/DEF layer map for icsprout55 (prtech/techLEF/N551P6M_ecos.lef stack).
# GDS numbers follow the PDK layer map (techfile/icsprout55.layermap, v1.10.103):
# datatype 1 = drawing, 2 = dummy fill, 6 = text. The PDK has no pin purpose,
# so DEF/LEF pins go on drawing and pin names on the text datatype, matching
# the standard-cell GDS (pin labels on 81/6).
# Columns: <LEF layer> <purposes> <GDS layer> <GDS datatype>

